    "Mods change the game's files only: mods that patch code (exefs, such as 60 fps patches) don't work. ": {
      "comment": "ModsPanel.swift:399",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mods change the game's files only: mods that patch code (exefs, such as 60 fps patches) don't work. "
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le mod modificano solo i file del gioco: quelle che applicano patch al codice (exefs, come le patch per 60 fps) non funzionano. "
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les mods modifient uniquement les fichiers du jeu : les mods qui modifient le code (exefs, comme les correctifs 60 FPS) ne fonctionnent pas. "
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mods ändern nur die Dateien des Spiels: Mods, die Code patchen (exefs, etwa 60-FPS-Patches), funktionieren nicht. "
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
