    "NX Library is personal software released under the MIT license. nxnative, Ryujinx, SPIR-V Cross, LibHac and the other dependencies retain their own licenses through the engine.": {
      "comment": "SettingsAboutSection.swift",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
