    "Summarizes the 4 essential gates: valid prod.keys, cloned nxnative repository, Python build environment, and certified Metal compiler version.": {
      "comment": "SettingsStartUpSection.swift",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Summarizes the 4 essential gates: valid prod.keys, cloned nxnative repository, Python build environment, and certified Metal compiler version."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Riepiloga i 4 requisiti essenziali: prod.keys valido, repository nxnative clonato, ambiente di compilazione Python e versione certificata del compilatore Metal."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Résume les 4 contrôles essentiels : prod.keys valide, dépôt nxnative cloné, environnement de compilation Python et version du compilateur Metal certifiée."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fasst die 4 grundlegenden Voraussetzungen zusammen: gültige prod.keys, geklontes nxnative-Repository, Python-Build-Umgebung und zertifizierte Metal-Compiler-Version."
          }
        },
